{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "d9f9e354-af2f-805e-9cf2-40a88643077d",
  "created_at": "2026-01-23T12:13:53-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Rosemarie Conti",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T12:11:17-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T12:11:19-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi Kevin, good afternoon. Um, my name's Rosemarie Conti. I've got a, oh hold on, let me put this down. Okay. I own a two-family and my tenants moved out last weekend, and they left a bunch of stuff out on the curb. A mattress, a busted chair, some boxes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T12:11:36-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so bulk waste after a move-out. Did it get picked up on the regular trash day?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T12:11:42-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's what I don't understand. I figured it'd go with the trash. It's still sitting there. Water bill, water bill, that's junk, that's, hm, that's the gas company. Sorry, I'm going through the mail here, it piled up all week."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T12:11:56-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, you're fine. Take your time. What's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T12:12:00-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "157 Gidley Street. Fifth Ward, off, you know, near the corner there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T12:12:05-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "157 Gidley, got it. So usually the big items like a mattress don't go out with the regular barrel pickup. They need to be scheduled separately."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T12:12:14-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Separately. Okay. So I was supposed to call before I put it out? Nobody told me that. The tenants just dragged it out there. Insurance, insurance, that's a, no, that's a catalog. Why do I get this."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T12:12:27-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, it happens. So I can put in a request for a bulk pickup for that address. Is it all on the curb in front of the house?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T12:12:37-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, in front. Wait, so is that a replacement for the pickup that didn't happen? Or is it a new one? I'm asking how I request a replacement. Is that the word?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T12:12:48-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not really a replacement, since it wasn't missed. It's a new bulk request. I'll write it up now. Mattress, chair, boxes, at 157 Gidley Street. Anything else out there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T12:12:58-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Um, maybe a lamp. A floor lamp. And the boxes might be flattened, I'm not sure. Should I have flattened them? Is that a recycling thing or a trash thing?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T12:13:08-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Flattened cardboard goes in recycling if it's clean. If they're full of stuff, that's part of the bulk. I'll note both."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T12:13:16-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So some of it's recycling and some of it's bulk, but it's all on the one pile. I'm sorry, I'm still a little mixed up. Do I have to separate it before they come?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T12:13:28-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "If you can pull the clean flat cardboard to one side, that helps. The rest can stay together. I'll put a note on the request."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T12:13:37-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright, I'll do that this afternoon. And you'll call me if there's a problem? It's 401-555-0189."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T12:13:43-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0189, Rosemarie Conti. Yep, I've got it down. Someone will follow up if they need anything."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T12:13:49-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Thank you, Kevin. I think I got it. Mostly."
    }
  ],
